<title>USA: First Union to deal in, underwrite equities.</title>
<headline>First Union to deal in, underwrite equities.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp, a unit of First Union Corp, said Monday it had received approval from the Federal Reserve to begin equity underwriting and dealing.</p>
<p>First Union Capital Markets said the authority includes the right of its high yield business to further expand into equity warrants and preferred stock activities.</p>
</text>
